Description: Wild OS app start tracking
 Follows each app from the moment it is started until its window opens,
 so the taskbar's starting line lasts exactly as long as the start, even
 when another window is clicked meanwhile. After sign-in the most used
 apps are read into memory at idle priority so they start quickly.
